meta-car-ecu
============

This layer contains the Yocto recipe for building the automotive ECU
simulation application.

Dependencies
============

This layer depends on:

- OpenEmbedded-Core (oe-core)

The application source code is included under:

    recipes-example/car-ecu/files/

Recipe
======

The main recipe is:

    recipes-example/car-ecu/car-ecu_1.0.bb

The recipe builds the C-based automotive ECU simulation application
using the Yocto cross-compiler and installs the resulting executable
as:

    /usr/bin/car_ecu_app

Build
=====

Add this layer to your Yocto build and run:

    bitbake car-ecu
